<SiteLayout title="Photo & Map Credits — Just Okinawa" description="Photographers and sources behind the images and map on Just Okinawa."><div class="wrap"><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">WITH THANKS</span><h1>The people behind<br/><em>the pictures.</em></h1></header><section class="content-section prose"><p>The site’s introductory photographs are by the photographers below, used under the <a href="https://unsplash.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Unsplash License</a>. Individual journal photographs are credited with their articles.</p><ul class="credits-list">{photos.map(p=><li><a href={p.source} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{p.photographer} — {p.file.split('/').pop()?.replace('.webp','')} ↗</a></li>)}</ul><h2>Map & typography</h2><p>Island outlines are derived from <a href="https://www.naturalearthdata.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Natural Earth</a>, public domain map data. The map is an introduction to selected destinations, not a navigation chart.</p><p>DM Sans, Cormorant Garamond and Noto Serif JP are distributed under the SIL Open Font License. Copies of the licenses are included with the site.</p></section></div></SiteLayout>
